        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Kansas\n- Products: Device – Voice – Drum, Leftoverture, Point of Know Return, The Best of Kansas, Two for the Show, Dust in the Wind\n- Topics: live albums, album certifications, music releases\n\nFacts:\n- Kansas is an American rock band.\n- Kansas produced eight gold albums, three multi-platinum albums, one platinum live album, and a million-selling single.\n- Kansas's three multi-platinum albums are \"Leftoverture,\" \"Point of Know Return,\" and \"The Best of Kansas.\"\n- Kansas's platinum live album is \"Two for the Show.\"\n- Kansas's million-selling single is \"Dust in the Wind.\"\n- In 2002, Kansas released \"Device – Voice – Drum\" as its fourth live album.",
